---
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Bottom from "../components/bottom-logo2.astro";
import Constuction from "../components/construction.astro";

import "../assets/styles/fonts.css";
import "../assets/styles/body.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-br">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
        <title>Preços de Turin</title>

        <meta
            name="description"
            content="Trânsito em tempo real para você sempre sair no horário certo."
        />
        <link rel="canonical" href="https://turinflow.com.br/" />
        <style>
            *,
            *::before,
            *::after {
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }

            :root {
                --brand-main: #ffd700;
                --brand-dark: #333;
                --bg-light: #f9f9f9;
                --light-2: #eee;
                --mid-color1: #bec1b9;
                --mid-color: #131b21;
                --darker-1: #474646;
            }

            body {
                background: linear-gradient(
                    0deg,
                    #eee 0%,
                    #e4e4e4 65%,
                    #555 100%
                );
            }

            .row {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            .row-reverse {
                flex-direction: row;
                row-gap: 0.6rem;
            }

            .images {
                height: 50vw;
                margin: 16px;
            }

            .font-default {
                height: calc(100vw * 0.091);
                font-size: clamp(25px, calc(100vw * 0.076), 165px);
                line-height: clamp(25px, calc(100vw * 0.076), 170px);
            }

            .images-flex {
                width: 95vw;
                display: flex;
                margin-inline: auto;
                justify-content: space-between;
                height: 1100px;
                gap: 1.3rem;
            }

            .widgets-1 {
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                flex: 0 0 30%;
                border: 1px solid #add1d1;
                padding: 0.5rem;
            }

            .frosted-glass {
                border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
                padding: 1rem;
                box-shadow:
                    inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05),
                    0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);

                background-color: rgba(130, 150, 160, 0.8);
                backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(150%);
                width: 90vw;
                margin-top: 0.3rem;
                margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
            }

            .widgets2 {
                ''width: 90vw;
            }

            .border-radius1,
            .border-radius2,
            .border-radius {
                border-radius: 18px 18px 18px 18px;
            }

            .mobile-text {
                text-align: center;
            }

            @media (min-width: 768px) {
                .mobile-text {
                    text-align: auto;
                }

                .row-reverse {
                    flex-direction: column;
                }

                .border-radius1 {
                    border-radius: 96px 18px 18px 18px;
                }

                .border-radius2 {
                    border-radius: 18px 18px 96px 18px;
                }

                .images {
                    height: 50%;
                    margin: 16px;
                }

                .font-default {
                    height: calc(100vw * 0.091);
                    font-size: clamp(25px, calc(100vw * 0.076), 165px);
                    line-height: clamp(25px, calc(100vw * 0.076), 170px);
                }

                .images-flex {
                    width: 85vw;
                    height: 550px;
                    gap: 0.5rem;
                }

                .widgets-1 {
                    flex: 0 0 32%;
                }
            }

            @media (min-width: 900px) {
                .row {
                    flex-direction: row;
                }

                .widgets2 {
                    width: 50%;
                    padding: 4rem;
                }
            }
        </style>
    </head>

    <script
        src="https://sp.turinflow.com.br/api/script.js"
        data-site-id="3a248a45ee62"
        defer
    ></script>
    <body>
        <Header />
        <div>
            <div
                class="s1"
                style="width: 85vw; padding-top: 4rem; font-size: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); line-height: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); margin-inline: auto; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #eee;"
            >
                PREÇOS
            </div>
            <div
                class="g2"
                style="letter-spacing: 1px;font-weight: 500; width: 85vw; padding-bottom: 4rem; font-size: 26px; line-height: 32px; color: #eee; margin-inline: auto;"
            >
                Aqui, divulgaremos os preços dos diferentes planos Turin. Pague
                mensalmente ou anualmente. Escolha o jeito que você preferir.
            </div>
            .
        </div>

        <div style="width: 90vw; margin-inline: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px 15px; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
            <div
                class="frosted-glass border-radius1"
                style="background-color: rgba(136, 155, 136, 0.45); border: 1px #aaa solid;"
            >
                <div
                    class="s1"
                    style="padding-top: 4rem; font-size: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); line-height: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); color: #eee; margin-inline: auto; margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center;"
                >
                    TURIN
                    <span class="g1" style="padding: 1rem; font-weight: 500;">
                        500
                    </span>
                </div>
                <div
                    class="g2"
                    style="font-weight: 500; padding-bottom: 8rem; font-size: 26px; line-height: 32px; color: #eee; margin-inline: auto; text-align: center;"
                >
                    Saiba mais sobre nosso melhor plano{" "}
                    <a
                        style="text-decoration-line: #eee; color: rgba(210, 210, 210, 1);"
                        href="/rotinas"
                    >
                        aqui
                    </a>
                    .
                </div>
            </div>

            <div
                class="row"
                style="display: flex; width: 90vw; height: auto; justify-content: space-between; row-gap: 15px; column-gap: 15px;"
            >
                <div
                    class="frosted-glass border-radius widgets2"
                    style="background-color: rgba(1, 1, 1, 0.35); border: 2px #bbb solid"
                >
                    <div
                        class="s1"
                        style="padding-top: 4rem; font-size: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); line-height: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); color: #eee; margin-inline: auto; margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center;"
                    >
                        TURIN NERO
                    </div>
                    <div
                        class="g2"
                        style="font-weight: 500; padding-bottom: 8rem; font-size: 26px; line-height: 32px; color: #eee; margin-inline: auto; text-align: center;"
                    >
                        Explore mais sua nova tranquilidade{" "}
                        <a
                            style="text-decoration-line: #eee; color: rgba(210, 210, 210, 1);"
                            href="/rotinas"
                        >
                            aqui
                        </a>
                        .
                        <div
                            class="g2"
                            style="font-weight: 500; font-size: 26px; line-height: 32px; color: #eee; margin-inline: auto; text-align: center; padding-top: 4px;"
                        >
                            R$ --
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div
                    class="frosted-glass border-radius widgets2"
                    style="background-color: rgba(50, 50, 200, 0.35); ; border: 2px #bbb solid"
                >
                    <div
                        class="s1"
                        style="padding-top: 4rem; font-size: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); line-height: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); color: #eee; margin-inline: auto; margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center;"
                    >
                        TURIN PLUS
                    </div>
                    <div
                        class="g2"
                        style="font-weight: 500; padding-bottom: 8rem; font-size: 26px; line-height: 32px; color: #eee; margin-inline: auto; text-align: center;"
                    >
                        Coordene sua vida inteira com Turin{" "}
                        <a
                            style="text-decoration-line: #eee; color: rgba(210, 210, 210, 1);"
                            href="/rotinas"
                        >
                            aqui
                        </a>
                        .
                        <div
                            class="g2"
                            style="font-weight: 500; font-size: 26px; line-height: 32px; color: #eee; margin-inline: auto; text-align: center; padding-top: 4px;"
                        >
                            R$ --
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div
                class="frosted-glass border-radius"
                style="border: 2px #ddd solid;"
            >
                <div
                    class="s1"
                    style="padding-top: 4rem; font-size: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); line-height: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); color: #eee; margin-inline: auto; margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center;"
                >
                    TURIN PILOTO
                </div>
                <div
                    class="g2"
                    style="font-weight: 500; padding-bottom: 8rem; font-size: 26px; line-height: 32px; color: #eee; margin-inline: auto; text-align: center;"
                >
                    Comece a explorar{" "}
                    <a
                        style="text-decoration-line: #eee; color: rgba(210, 210, 210, 1);"
                        href="/rotinas"
                    >
                        aqui
                    </a>
                    .
                    <div
                        class="g2"
                        style="font-weight: 500; font-size: 26px; line-height: 32px; color: #eee; margin-inline: auto; text-align: center;"
                    >
                        Sem custo para você.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div
                class="frosted-glass border-radius2"
                style="background-color: rgba(240, 245, 240, 0.5); width: 90vw; margin-inline: auto; border: 1px #ccc solid"
            >
                <div
                    class="g1 mobile-text"
                    style="width: 85vw; padding-top: 4rem; font-size: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); line-height: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); margin-inline: auto; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #888;"
                >
                    Ainda em dúvida?
                </div>
                <div
                    class="g2 mobile-text"
                    style="letter-spacing: 1px;font-weight: 500; width: 75vw; padding-bottom: 4rem; font-size: 26px; line-height: 32px; color: #888; margin-inline: auto;"
                >
                    Tente Turin Piloto. Simule a vida de alguém ou reorganize
                    sua vida inteira com Turin, sem incorrer nenhum custo.{" "}
                    <a
                        style="color: #888; text-decoration-line: #888"
                        href="/rotinas"
                    >
                        Comece aqui
                    </a>
                    .
                </div>
                .
            </div>
        </div>
    </body>
    <Bottom />
</html>
